    "title": "5 Unique Sets to Catch at Seven Stars this Year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jaclyn Sersland ,\n1 days ago Seven Stars is officially two weeks away. Before you start planning your schedule, read on for our five must-see artists performing this year. Last year, GRiZ made his return to the EDM scene in Arrington, Virginia, at the inaugural edition of his very own festival, Valley of the Seven Stars. Now, there’s only two weeks to go until Seven Stars returns to the scenic Blue Ridge Mountains on October 9-11. Read full article",
